# Crossroads_06 from the Mound's door (the top platform, x 24.5 y 30.39) down the room to the Gate Switch, a nail swing at it from x 7.9
# facing left, and out through the pillar it opens into Crossroads_33 (arrival x 44.5, y 34.4). Planned with hk-walkplan room (margin 0.4);
# the pillar is waited out by pushing left until the arrival, so no timer stands in for its 1.5 s.
at 24.54 30.39
walk 21.50
walk 21.93   # run-up
walk 21.50   # take-off
hold left+cross for 24
hold left for 28
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
